  "question": {
    "text": "Bond dissociation energy of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> bond of the &quot;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math>&quot; hydrides of group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math> elements (given below), follows order.<br />(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br />(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math><br />(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Se</mi></math><br />(D) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Te</mi></math>",
